  <name>BeatBox</name>
  <summary>Music player for your collection, podcasts and internet radio</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      BeatBox plays and organizes your music collection, with playlists and
      smart playlists, Cover Flow and a cover grid, podcasts and internet
      radio directories, synced lyrics, a live spectrum in the display,
      gapless playback, crossfade and ReplayGain.
    </p>
    <p>
      It can keep the library in step with your music folder, look up missing
      album art online, and send your listens to Last.fm or ListenBrainz.
    </p>
  </description>
